# Kagome 12: ground state (Gamma, irrep X2 = C6 -1 and mirror S0 +1, flip +1; E0 = -5.444 875 216, Lauchli et al. 2011)
# and its spin structure factor at two momenta
lattice kagome a1=2,0 a2=0,2
couplings J1=1
sector Sz=0 k=0,0 irrep=X2 flip=+1
solve device=cpu
measure S Qr=1,0                         # Q = b1, a reciprocal-lattice vector (extended zone)
measure S Qr=0.5,0                       # Q = b1/2, an M point of the first zone
